+            "",
+            f"RMS-relative error is {amp['additive_relative_error']:.6f} for the additive part, {amp['interaction_relative_error']:.6f} for the interaction part, and {amp['joint_relative_error']:.6f} for their sum. Thus the realised relative error of the sum is {amp['relative_amplification_vs_additive']:.6f} times the additive part's relative error. Median rowwise absolute relative errors (excluding exact magnitudes <=1e-8) are {amp['additive_rowwise_relative_median']:.6f}, {amp['interaction_rowwise_relative_median']:.6f}, and {amp['joint_rowwise_relative_median']:.6f}, respectively.",
+            "",
